        detailedAnswer: 'Configure per-topic: `cleanup.policy=compact`. A background cleaner thread merges log segments, keeping the most recent record per key. Tombstone: a record with a null value permanently deletes a key from the compacted log. Common use case: a `users` compacted topic where each message key = user_id and value = latest user JSON. A new consumer reading from offset 0 gets the current state of every user ever written — useful for rebuilding state without a snapshot database.',
